WEBVTT

00:12.310 --> 00:13.490
What?

00:14.130 --> 00:15.490
There's no denying it.

00:16.110 --> 00:19.920
We're seeing a dramatic 
decline in solar activity.

00:19.920 --> 00:22.660
Must be causing 
all the recent weather anomalies.

00:22.980 --> 00:26.290
We even got reports of 
sakura blooming in S2E4,

00:26.290 --> 00:28.600
long after the start of the new year.

00:28.600 --> 00:31.290
Cherry blossoms! In full bloom!

00:31.290 --> 00:33.440
You mean that wasn't just a continuity error?

00:33.820 --> 00:35.310
Wait, that also means...

00:35.310 --> 00:39.680
This was the reason that that one night 
in Akagi lasted 19 whole years?!

00:41.010 --> 00:43.060
If nothing changes, then in a few years...

00:43.870 --> 00:44.560
No.

00:45.580 --> 00:47.200
It may even happen in a few months...

00:48.560 --> 00:52.060
Earth will once again 
be plunged into an ice age!

01:11.750 --> 01:16.960
<b>The 100 Girlfriends
Who Really, Really, Really, Really,
REALLY Love You</b>

01:17.790 --> 01:20.630
Karane

01:17.790 --> 01:20.630
as the
Tsundere Princess

01:20.630 --> 01:22.920
Mei

01:20.630 --> 01:22.920
Demonstration
Tea-Time Prep

01:22.920 --> 01:24.510
Hakari

01:22.920 --> 01:24.510
Suggestive Weight-Loss
Running

01:24.510 --> 01:25.760
Kurumi

01:24.510 --> 01:25.760
Ate all of the
school store's bread

01:25.760 --> 01:27.260
Mimimi

01:25.760 --> 01:27.260
(Getting ready)
Two hours later

01:28.430 --> 01:30.970
Nano

01:28.430 --> 01:30.970
Robot that
exercises for her

01:30.970 --> 01:33.390
Shizuka

01:30.970 --> 01:33.390
Has 365 book
recommendations
this week

01:33.390 --> 01:35.690
Kusuri

01:33.390 --> 01:35.690
Has newly developed
drug that gives
you sweet dreams

01:35.690 --> 01:36.350
Hahari

01:35.690 --> 01:36.350
Chairperson's Address
"Education" and "Love"

01:36.350 --> 01:37.020
Iku

01:36.350 --> 01:37.020
Has been doing
push-ups since yesterday

01:37.020 --> 01:38.560
Meme

01:37.020 --> 01:38.560
Customized Plushy-
Rentaro-kun

01:38.690 --> 01:43.400
<b>Rentaro-kun Appreciation Opening</b>

01:46.160 --> 01:47.830
Meme-san added ears

01:46.160 --> 01:47.830
and a tail for you!

01:53.460 --> 01:55.500
<b>Rentaro-kun (& Others) Appreciation Opening</b>

02:30.570 --> 02:32.860
<i>"What seems to be the matter, Rentaro-kun?"</i>

02:32.860 --> 02:33.380
Huh?

02:33.790 --> 02:35.020
What do you mean?

02:35.020 --> 02:38.120
You look like something's 
been eating at you lately.

02:38.120 --> 02:39.380
Oh, bet you...

02:39.650 --> 02:41.390
It's cause of this, aye!

02:41.930 --> 02:43.640
<i>"Full chrome dome."</i>

02:43.980 --> 02:46.060
Ever since the beauty search...

02:46.060 --> 02:48.640
...you've had on a wig and stick-on brows?

02:48.640 --> 02:52.780
Never fear! 
Kusuri has new Hair-Growing Medicine!

02:52.780 --> 02:53.780
Ahem.

02:53.780 --> 02:57.980
And because it allows us 
to reset our hair at will,

02:57.980 --> 03:01.810
we will now commence a day of hair-styling.

03:01.810 --> 03:03.380
Who're you supposed to be, lady?

03:03.980 --> 03:06.340
I'm not your lady, young lady!

03:06.340 --> 03:08.300
Try to call me "Mommy" sometime.

03:08.300 --> 03:09.820
Shut up! Back off!

03:09.820 --> 03:14.720
I'm no professional, but I practiced to 
live up to Hahari-sama's hopes today.

03:14.080 --> 03:15.590
<b>Today's Stylist</b>

03:16.050 --> 03:18.090
Here I go.

03:18.090 --> 03:19.720
Open your eyes, pretty please!

03:19.720 --> 03:21.470
<b>And so...</b>

03:20.050 --> 03:21.470
<i>And so...</i>

03:27.760 --> 03:30.600
A full burst of charm!

03:30.600 --> 03:33.230
Bam!

03:33.620 --> 03:36.520
<i>She didn't open her eyes, 
but she did a good job.</i>

03:37.020 --> 03:39.790
Zo gute... I feel like I'm about to drool.

03:39.790 --> 03:41.490
You already are.

03:41.740 --> 03:43.110
<b>ding</b>

03:43.750 --> 03:48.420
Kusuri-chan, do you have the Hair-Control 
Medicine you mentioned before?

03:48.420 --> 03:50.000
Sure do, aye.

03:52.050 --> 03:52.880
Om...

03:55.650 --> 03:58.060
It'll be fun to play around with long hair.

03:58.060 --> 04:01.760
Th-That's a bad mix! Phtooey it, now!

04:08.760 --> 04:11.210
Her hair became a cocoon.

04:11.210 --> 04:13.640
Everybody run! Not safe!

04:13.640 --> 04:15.400
H-Hahari-sama!

04:15.400 --> 04:16.280
Don't be dumb, Mei!

04:16.280 --> 04:17.940
A seamless Totoro reference!

04:25.790 --> 04:28.640
I-I'm so sorry, Rentaro-sama.

04:28.640 --> 04:29.240
I'm oka—

04:29.240 --> 04:30.750
Run, Mei!

04:30.750 --> 04:31.370
The hair!

04:38.520 --> 04:40.180
Back inside, everyone.

04:43.030 --> 04:45.410
What happened to her, Kusuri-senpai?

04:45.410 --> 04:49.510
Simply, Hair-Control Medicine 
bond hair and brain,

04:49.930 --> 04:54.770
and Hair-Growing Medicine 
activate and strengthen the hair.

04:54.770 --> 05:00.770
When mixed, the activated hair overpower 
and take over the brain instead!

05:01.130 --> 05:03.150
Mankind was not ready for this power!

05:03.630 --> 05:09.660
But hair don't think. 
It simply following Hahari's primal urge.

05:09.660 --> 05:11.420
Could it be...

05:11.420 --> 05:13.560
There's only one thing it could be.

05:13.560 --> 05:15.250
Petting cute things—

05:15.250 --> 05:16.460
Tentacle porn.

05:16.460 --> 05:17.170
Hey!

05:17.170 --> 05:18.660
She gets it!

05:18.660 --> 05:20.290
Like mother, like daughter.

05:20.290 --> 05:23.950
Unless we wake Hahari up, 
hair will continue to go wild.

05:23.950 --> 05:27.780
But how? If we approach her, 
her hair will make tentacle porn out of us.

05:27.780 --> 05:30.450
Probably for ever and ever.

05:30.450 --> 05:34.350
If it's coming after us, 
all we can do at the moment is run.

05:36.200 --> 05:38.060
Watch out! Mei-san!

05:39.740 --> 05:41.470
Kurumi-sama, no!

05:48.460 --> 05:51.150
H-Hahari-san?

05:56.580 --> 05:58.220
Kurumi!

05:56.580 --> 05:59.830
D-Damn you, you sleazeball witch!

05:58.220 --> 05:59.830
I know it hurts, but save yourself.

06:05.350 --> 06:08.390
Running, in my halls? Taste the whip of love!

06:08.840 --> 06:11.220
Different witch incoming!

06:15.260 --> 06:16.970
It got around us?

06:16.970 --> 06:18.480
We're getting pincer attacked!

06:18.800 --> 06:21.660
Take this. Might help later.

06:21.660 --> 06:22.480
"Interrobang."

06:22.750 --> 06:25.460
<i>Kusuri drug caused this!</i>

06:30.280 --> 06:31.820
Kusuri-senpai!

06:31.820 --> 06:34.270
Run while you have the chance, everyone!

06:34.270 --> 06:37.040
<i>"Uh oh, we've got stragglers."</i>

06:40.550 --> 06:41.850
You idiot! What are you—

06:41.850 --> 06:45.170
Not much. Just cleaning up after Mother.

06:46.890 --> 06:49.490
What are you doing? Let me go!

06:49.490 --> 06:50.930
Not on your life, you moron!

06:50.930 --> 06:52.930
Let me go! Let—

06:52.930 --> 06:54.930
Shaddup! I'd rather die than let you go!

06:54.930 --> 06:56.560
Yeah, no, I mean it!

06:56.860 --> 06:59.250
You're ripping my arm out! Ow, ow!

06:59.250 --> 06:59.940
Oh, my bad.

07:03.060 --> 07:04.530
Hakari!

07:04.530 --> 07:06.090
I can't believe you, Karane-san!

07:06.090 --> 07:08.070
What do you want from me?!

07:11.380 --> 07:13.570
Our car's parked outside!

07:16.770 --> 07:19.580
We've got big <i>To Love Ru</i> outside!

07:21.310 --> 07:23.740
Excellent. The car is safe.

07:23.740 --> 07:27.410
Not even Hanazono Hahari 
could lust after machinery.

07:27.410 --> 07:29.590
Nah, we'd be screwed 
if this was a cringemobile.

07:36.980 --> 07:39.500
Why? Why won't the car move?

07:40.170 --> 07:41.470
Could it be...

07:41.470 --> 07:42.350
What is it?

07:42.350 --> 07:45.650
The production committee must be afraid of 
getting canceled for overloading the car.

07:45.650 --> 07:48.230
We've already gone through 
20 episodes of problematic material!

07:50.990 --> 07:53.740
No, her hair has a hold of this car!

07:53.740 --> 07:56.240
She won't allow the beauty, me, 
and the best, you, to escape!

08:02.260 --> 08:04.090
Mei-san, floor it!

08:04.090 --> 08:05.500
Pedal to the metal!

08:05.860 --> 08:07.500
Iku? Karane?!

08:07.910 --> 08:10.260
<i>Iku-sama... Karane-sama...</i>

08:13.870 --> 08:15.760
<i>Your sacrifice won't be in vain.</i>

08:19.820 --> 08:23.020
Iku! Karane!

08:24.290 --> 08:26.600
We might be showing off a bit too hard here.

08:26.600 --> 08:28.930
Iku, get your bat and your butt ready.

08:28.930 --> 08:29.690
Huh?

08:29.980 --> 08:30.530
Here?

08:38.810 --> 08:40.140
The pain...

08:42.960 --> 08:46.710
I-It's not like this feels good 
or anything, okay?!

08:46.710 --> 08:48.960
Karane!

08:53.020 --> 08:54.730
It's stretching along the fence...

08:54.730 --> 08:56.970
trying to head us off at the gate!

09:00.540 --> 09:01.970
Go, while I've got a hold on them!

09:02.260 --> 09:03.100
Iku-sama!

09:03.390 --> 09:06.980
I'm not letting Karane steal the whole show.

09:10.110 --> 09:11.980
<i>They wrapped around my arm?</i>

09:13.300 --> 09:15.740
<i>Both sides are trying to pull me in?!</i>

09:16.890 --> 09:18.410
I'm getting ripped apart...

09:18.410 --> 09:21.240
The pain!

09:19.380 --> 09:21.240
Iku!

09:21.240 --> 09:22.780
What the?

09:37.890 --> 09:41.000
Nowhere on Earth is safe!

09:41.000 --> 09:43.790
It'd be most effective to escape 
to the roof of that building there.

09:48.820 --> 09:51.650
Mei-san, Shizuka-chan. Hurry, you two.

09:51.960 --> 09:54.050
Everyone, please...

09:54.050 --> 09:55.100
<i>"Be well!"</i>

10:12.060 --> 10:15.200
She used the BunBun Fantasy 
Medicine to become cuter

10:15.200 --> 10:19.310
so she could distract the hair 
while we get to the roof.

10:19.310 --> 10:20.420
No!

10:20.420 --> 10:21.930
Wait!

10:22.270 --> 10:26.810
We must keep going, or their 
sacrifices would have been for naught.

10:30.100 --> 10:31.810
Let us on.

10:32.280 --> 10:37.490
S-Sorry. We can only fit one... 
maybe two more, at most.

10:37.830 --> 10:41.240
There's no time. The hair's coming for us.

10:41.810 --> 10:44.510
I feel like they could fit some more people.

10:44.510 --> 10:46.750
Forget the elevator.

10:47.150 --> 10:51.150
While the hair's distracted, 
the stairs are an effective escape route.

11:09.290 --> 11:10.780
Are you serious?

11:24.680 --> 11:25.780
Is this...

11:28.920 --> 11:30.270
Is this how the show ends?!

11:32.290 --> 11:36.630
What exactly is this strange substance 
that has overrun the world?

11:36.630 --> 11:39.130
<b>World In Danger</b>

11:36.880 --> 11:39.130
<i>Is it a plant? A creature?</i>

11:42.060 --> 11:45.010
Why do I smell a sweet, floral scent?

11:46.140 --> 11:49.140
Eek!

11:51.600 --> 11:53.030
Hair is hair.

11:55.300 --> 11:57.400
If it's bothering you, just cut it off.

11:59.310 --> 12:04.030
I have achieved 
perfect mastery over hair brushing.

12:04.410 --> 12:07.030
I can brush this off in style!

12:14.770 --> 12:19.670
I knew your expertise in beauty 
would be helpful, Utsukushisugi Mimimi.

12:20.310 --> 12:24.180
B-But of course. 
And your panache with that blade...

12:25.010 --> 12:29.060
makes you a worthy sister-at-arms!

12:32.490 --> 12:36.440
<i>Damn it... How could I get myself injured?</i>

12:36.890 --> 12:38.690
<i>I should be the one keeping them safe,</i>

12:38.990 --> 12:40.440
<i>not the other way around!</i>

12:46.070 --> 12:47.200
Rentaro-kun!

12:47.200 --> 12:48.580
Aijo Rentaro!

12:54.840 --> 12:55.960
No...

12:56.380 --> 12:58.880
Mimimi-senpai! Nano!

13:00.850 --> 13:02.210
<i>Shit, shit, shit!</i>

13:02.580 --> 13:04.080
<i>What can I do?!</i>

13:04.590 --> 13:05.980
Rentaro-sama.

13:06.750 --> 13:08.730
Nano-sama, Mimimi-sama!

13:08.730 --> 13:10.700
<i>"Here to get ya, buddy."</i>

13:13.230 --> 13:15.350
Mei-san... Shizuka-chan?

13:15.350 --> 13:17.100
<i>But how?</i>

13:17.100 --> 13:18.100
Well...

13:18.610 --> 13:20.710
<i>"Watch out on the right!"</i>

13:20.710 --> 13:21.980
<i>"Now left!"</i>

13:23.070 --> 13:26.860
We were able to escape thanks to 
Shizuka-sama's enhanced BunBun hearing.

13:26.860 --> 13:31.890
<i>"And we stopped by the Hanazono 
home and picked up this ride."</i>

13:31.890 --> 13:34.740
<i>The Hanazonos have their own copter?!</i>

13:34.740 --> 13:39.380
Yes, to get a bird's-eye view should you 
partake in an outdoor hot spring someday.

13:39.980 --> 13:42.070
Nano! Mimimi-senpai!

13:43.180 --> 13:44.880
We're done for.

13:45.230 --> 13:47.250
Go ahead, Aijo Rentaro!

13:47.250 --> 13:49.560
Hurry, before it claims us all!

13:49.560 --> 13:50.390
But I can't...

13:51.030 --> 13:55.310
No one can save the world 
from this absurdity...

13:55.710 --> 13:57.390
...save for one person.

13:57.810 --> 13:59.520
Hahari-san's only boyfriend in the world...

13:59.520 --> 14:01.280
...you!

14:02.270 --> 14:05.280
Eek, I say!

14:08.430 --> 14:12.110
Nano! Mimimi-senpai!

14:17.040 --> 14:20.850
The hair can't come for us at this altitude.

14:20.850 --> 14:23.420
<i>"But what can we do now?"</i>

14:23.890 --> 14:26.280
I want you to take me somewhere.

14:26.280 --> 14:28.430
I've been thinking...

14:29.000 --> 14:33.680
about how to fix this situation, 
and this chopper might just help.

14:34.230 --> 14:36.680
<i>"Where is your objective?"</i>

14:38.900 --> 14:41.280
The eye of this catastrophic storm...

14:45.960 --> 14:47.180
The center of the scalp!

14:58.460 --> 15:02.670
<i>Rentaro-chan, girls... I'm sorry.</i>

15:03.490 --> 15:04.960
<i>I'm so sorry.</i>

15:05.980 --> 15:10.970
We've arrived above 
Ohana-no-Mitsu University High School.

15:12.890 --> 15:16.020
<i>"Will this strategy truly work?"</i>

15:16.020 --> 15:18.600
If this fails, you will be...

15:19.090 --> 15:20.070
I...

15:21.030 --> 15:22.980
I am Hahari-san's boyfriend, after all.

15:24.330 --> 15:25.610
I'll be back!

15:26.350 --> 15:29.500
<i>If the hair is moving on 
Hahari-san's instincts,</i>

15:29.500 --> 15:32.260
<i>then it won't just attack all that's cute.</i>

15:32.260 --> 15:33.870
<i>It'll feed off her endless love for us...</i>

15:37.430 --> 15:39.500
<i>and protect us with all it's got!</i>

15:42.290 --> 15:43.460
<i>Yes!</i>

15:43.460 --> 15:47.160
<i>It's not easy to slow down 
a fall from that height.</i>

15:47.160 --> 15:50.880
<i>Even if I land badly 
and break every bone in my body,</i>

15:50.880 --> 15:53.280
<i>I'll take it as long as I don't die!</i>

15:53.280 --> 15:57.140
<i>If I can talk to Hahari-san, I can wake her!</i>

15:57.550 --> 15:59.440
<i>I can do this!</i>

15:59.890 --> 16:03.040
<i>I'm coming for you, Hahari-san!</i>

16:16.850 --> 16:18.410
Really, now?

16:20.430 --> 16:24.660
I was having a good time in the afterlife 
after you gave me peace.

16:25.070 --> 16:30.420
But then I see Hahari's lost herself in joy, 
and you're risking your life to save her.

16:30.870 --> 16:34.080
You're too lovable to leave alone...

16:35.180 --> 16:36.930
You and Hahari both.

16:41.240 --> 16:42.620
Off you go.

17:05.210 --> 17:06.330
Hahari-san!

17:09.590 --> 17:12.820
Hahari-san... Wake up!

17:12.820 --> 17:13.800
Hahari-san!

17:16.330 --> 17:18.620
<i>She's not just asleep.</i>

17:18.620 --> 17:20.810
<i>The hair's taken over her mind.</i>

17:21.150 --> 17:25.810
<i>I need something stronger 
to get through to her heart, her soul...</i>

17:26.320 --> 17:27.950
<i>I must get through directly to her.</i>

17:45.990 --> 17:48.200
Rentaro-chan...?

17:52.050 --> 17:54.790
I'm so sorry, Rentaro-chan!

17:58.960 --> 18:03.600
I could see everything 
while I was trapped in there.

18:03.890 --> 18:09.720
I saw what I did to you all... 
and the entire world!

18:09.720 --> 18:17.950
At this point, I can't free the planet 
from all this hair even if I'm awake!

18:17.950 --> 18:21.930
I've ruined our world for everyone!

18:22.360 --> 18:26.620
Don't worry. It'll be all right.

18:27.100 --> 18:28.990
Don't you remember?

18:28.990 --> 18:32.970
You took two drugs, 
the Hair-Growing Medicine and one other.

18:34.960 --> 18:36.480
Ouchy!

18:37.250 --> 18:41.370
Mother... p-please, stop...

18:41.370 --> 18:43.690
She did, ages ago.

18:43.690 --> 18:47.390
Rentaro and others musta woken Hahari up!

19:36.500 --> 19:39.910
Hahari-sama, lunch is ready.

19:40.270 --> 19:43.570
Mother, you have to eat.

19:44.190 --> 19:45.940
What's done is done.

19:58.420 --> 19:59.520
Hahari-san.

20:03.920 --> 20:05.290
Rentaro-chan...

20:05.290 --> 20:07.690
Sorry for barging in.

20:08.270 --> 20:11.400
But there's something I need you to see.

20:13.220 --> 20:17.610
<i>An update on the recent Earth-Covered-
In-Nice-Smelling-Hairlike-Things Incident.</i>

20:18.210 --> 20:22.420
<i>Despite the massive scale of the disaster, 
no casualties were reported.</i>

20:22.420 --> 20:26.690
<i>Witnesses say the hairlike things themselves 
prevented anyone from being injured.</i>

20:26.690 --> 20:30.120
<i>Those caught in the locks described a feeling 
akin to a mother's warm embrace.</i>

20:30.590 --> 20:33.860
<i>Some are petitioning for a rerun, 
and the Super Sweet Scent...</i>

20:33.860 --> 20:37.320
<i>Whoa! And we have even more breaking news!</i>

20:37.320 --> 20:41.130
<i>Let's hear from the What's Up 
With the Sun? Lab in the North Pole!</i>

20:41.130 --> 20:54.890
<b>Breaking</b>

20:41.130 --> 20:54.890
<b>Live from the What's Up With the Sun? Research Lab</b>

20:41.520 --> 20:46.290
<i>U-Uh, right, I'm reporting live 
from the lab... or something.</i>

20:46.290 --> 20:50.740
<i>So, uh, solar activity 
was down and stuff, maybe?</i>

20:50.740 --> 20:54.890
<i>But the hair burning was like, 
adding fuel to the fire, I guess?</i>

20:54.890 --> 20:59.780
<i>And it's okay now. Er, the sun, I mean.</i>

20:59.780 --> 21:04.030
<i>We kinda assumed we were entering 
an ice age, but not anymore. Who knows?</i>

21:04.760 --> 21:06.030
<i>That's all we've got.</i>

21:09.030 --> 21:14.220
Hahari-san, you saved Earth. 
You saved this world we all live in.

21:15.620 --> 21:18.220
<i>Detecting a decline in solar activity?!</i>

21:18.220 --> 21:20.310
<i>It could cause a new ice age?!</i>

21:20.760 --> 21:23.510
<i>But if that happens, Earth...</i>

21:23.920 --> 21:25.210
<i>and everyone on it...</i>

21:25.210 --> 21:27.290
<i>Damn, what do I do?</i>

21:27.290 --> 21:30.930
<i>It's a boyfriend's job to save the planet 
his girlfriends live on!</i>

21:33.020 --> 21:37.880
Thank you so, so much, Hahari-san!

21:37.880 --> 21:39.190
Rentaro-chan...

21:40.900 --> 21:46.950
<i>He burned the hair to save the Earth 
and free me from guilt?</i>

21:46.950 --> 21:48.670
Wait, Karane-san!

21:47.820 --> 21:49.730
How long are you gonna mope about?

21:49.730 --> 21:50.950
It ain't like you.

21:50.950 --> 21:53.200
Y-You're all here...

21:53.740 --> 21:55.920
You're wasting time being unproductive.

21:55.920 --> 21:57.120
